        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Churchville%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Churchville sits within the Staunton–Waynesboro Micropolitan Statistical Area, linking it to the broader Shenandoah Valley economy.",
